# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Outfit Avenue - Environment Configuration Example
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1. Frontend Client Configuration (Vite - Publicly Exposed in Browser)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key
VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2. Server-Side Payment Gateway Secrets (DO NOT EXPOSE IN FRONTEND CODE)
# Set these securely in Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> Edge Functions -> Secrets
# or using Supabase CLI: supabase secrets set KEY=VALUE
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# --- bKash Tokenized Checkout (v1.2.0-pg) ---
# BKASH_MODE=sandbox                         # 'sandbox' or 'live'
# BKASH_APP_KEY=your_bkash_app_key
# BKASH_APP_SECRET=your_bkash_app_secret
# BKASH_USERNAME=your_bkash_merchant_username
# BKASH_PASSWORD=your_bkash_merchant_password

# --- Nagad Online Payment Gateway ---
# NAGAD_MODE=sandbox                         # 'sandbox' or 'live'
# NAGAD_MERCHANT_ID=your_nagad_merchant_id
# NAGAD_PUBLIC_KEY=your_nagad_pgw_public_key
# NAGAD_PRIVATE_KEY=your_merchant_private_key

# --- Card & Online Payment (SSLCommerz Gateway) ---
# SSLCOMMERZ_MODE=sandbox                    # 'sandbox' or 'live'
# SSLCOMMERZ_STORE_ID=your_sslcommerz_store_id
# SSLCOMMERZ_STORE_PASS=your_sslcommerz_store_password
